            <ArticleTitle>New bifurcation stenting technique: shunt stenting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>474-81</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The optimal treatment of bifurcation lesions remains controversial. We describe a new technique we term shunt stenting. This technique incorporates both the new technology of drug-eluting stents and a novel procedure for optimizing the ostial side branch stent positioning. To date, early angiographic and clinical follow-up have been encouraging.</AbstractText>
